      "text": "Dinsdag, 23:40.\nThe pumps on the Herengracht have failed. Pieter went down to check the water gate in the kelder. He came back up soaked to the bone and would not speak.\nAn hour ago he walked out the front door. Into the water.\nI have locked the cellar. The key is on the mantel.\nIf you are reading this, do not go down there.\n- Marit"
